  voiceSubs:
  - It is good that thou art making headway, but hurry!
  - Thou must learn as much as thou art able of the Talismans.
  - Sir Cabirus created them, and thou shouldst collect all eight.
  - Talk to the inhabitants of the Abyss. Some are still civilized and can help thee
    locate them.
  - Thou art the final hope in this dramatis subterranae...
